{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"4508570","name":"真理谭：黑暗城堡的女巫","type":"game","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>翻开此书，你便不再只是 “读者”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/b3ece2903b164576d7e0a8a903f06b94.poster.avif?t=1783665720\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/b3ece2903b164576d7e0a8a903f06b94.webm?t=1783665720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/b3ece2903b164576d7e0a8a903f06b94.mp4?t=1783665720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家将通过翻阅书籍、做出重重选择、与敌人战斗来不断成长。你可以选择用肌肉蛮力对决、用三寸不烂之舌交涉，甚至假装没看见直接走人，一切皆取决于你。你的选择和骰子的点数，决定了这个世界将如何改变、将呈现什么姿态。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>前Vanillaware（香草社）游戏人历时6年制作，纯手绘300多张插画</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/2bd1079b3ee27cfbbbd503f6f84381a2.poster.avif?t=1783665720\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/2bd1079b3ee27cfbbbd503f6f84381a2.webm?t=1783665720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/2bd1079b3ee27cfbbbd503f6f84381a2.mp4?t=1783665720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >制作人西村芳雄曾参与香草社《奥丁领域》、《龙之皇冠》等作品背景制作，在闯荡游戏业界30余年后，选择“隐居”于日本深山，历时6年匠心打造了这部作品。他亲手绘制了游戏内超过300张的插画，全程未使用任何生成式AI 。纯手工制作的背后，保留着能够直击人心的那份感动。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>来体验一下“奇幻”的原点吧！</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/1847e1af83fde677a671ab79cb21af16.poster.avif?t=1783665720\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/1847e1af83fde677a671ab79cb21af16.webm?t=1783665720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/extras/1847e1af83fde677a671ab79cb21af16.mp4?t=1783665720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《艾尔登法环》、《博德之门3》、《迷宫饭》......这些让我们心潮澎湃的当代奇幻作品的源头，是一个曾属于“游戏书（Gamebook）”和“TRPG（桌上角色扮演游戏）”的时代。本作完美再现了曾几何时“剑与魔法应有的分量与质感”，所以不妨配合着纸张的触感，一起来品味曾被称为“奇幻”之物的原点吧。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>开发者简介</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >西村芳雄（Nishimura Yoshio）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digitalis Publishing负责人。拥有30年以上的游戏业界经验。曾作为背景制作团队的主管，在Capcom参与初代《怪物猎人》等作品、在Vanillaware（香草社）参与了《奥丁领域》、《龙之皇冠》等作品的制作。从香草社独立后，定居于日本奈良县深山里的一座小村庄“曾尔村”，一边耕田务农一边潜心进行游戏创作。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>游戏相关信息</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>文本量</strong>：20万字以上 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>预计游玩时间</strong>：20小时以上 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>多周目要素</strong>：有 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>游玩风格</strong>：可通过“战斗”、“交涉”或“回避”中的任一方式推进剧情 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>音乐</strong>：崎元仁／Basiscape（代表作：《最终幻想战略版》、《放浪冒险谭》、《十三机兵防卫圈》等）</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>致敬作品</strong>：《圣杯任务》（Grailquest）、《魔法巫术》（Sorcery!）、《战斗幻想》（Fighting Fantasy）</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/7f4d25988802019907244ae7f5d09b208c72e775/header_schinese.jpg?t=1783665720","website":"https://15industry.co.jp/wordpress/wdc/","developers":["ジギタリス出版"],"publishers":["15 Industry"],"release_date":"2026 年 7 月 8 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"16.99","final":"15.29","discount":10},"supported_languages":"英语, 简体中文, 日语<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","可以仅用鼠标","无需应对快速反应事件","随时保存","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["冒险","独立","角色扮演"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/c3019743e0810c9f5a117eae6d21346996f4e9d1/ss_c3019743e0810c9f5a117eae6d21346996f4e9d1.600x338.jpg?t=1783665720","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/c3019743e0810c9f5a117eae6d21346996f4e9d1/ss_c3019743e0810c9f5a117eae6d21346996f4e9d1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783665720"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/6ac562516837c62b8c005e325d6669b669687037/ss_6ac562516837c62b8c005e325d6669b669687037.600x338.jpg?t=1783665720","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/6ac562516837c62b8c005e325d6669b669687037/ss_6ac562516837c62b8c005e325d6669b669687037.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783665720"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/e04ed2655eaad2b9099797f56089e412abc2db9a/ss_e04ed2655eaad2b9099797f56089e412abc2db9a.600x338.jpg?t=1783665720","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508570/e04ed2655eaad2b9099797f56089e412abc2db9a/ss_e04ed2655eaad2b9099797f56089e412abc2db9a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783665720"}]}